      "limits_ja": "報酬の種類と測定する動機を区別。褒めると必ずやる気が消えるという結論ではない。",
      "formal_evidence_certainty": "not_assessed"
    },
    {
      "id": "EV-PSY-MOT-007-SRC129",
      "topic_id": "PSY-MOT-007",
      "source_id": "SRC129",
      "relation_role": "direct_or_targeted_evidence",
